    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d35">

                <pb facs="0103" n="43" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg43"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-19"><hi rendition="#italic">December 19, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received Dec. 20.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have been orally informed that the flour claims will be paid, but that it is
                    necessary for Congress to make appropriation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
